ֵה measuring-reed Ezek 40:3 , 5 ; 42:16 (strike out Co), 42:16 ; 42:17 ; 42:18 ; 42:19 . 2 measurement, size of curtains in tabernacle Exod 26:2 , 8 ; 36:9 , 15 (all P); compare 1Kin 6:25 ; 7:37 (both || קֶצֶב ), 7:9 ; 7:11 ; 2Chr 3:3 ; Ezek 40:10 (twice in verse); 40:21-22 , 24 , 28 , 29 , 32 , 33 , 35 ; 43:13 ; 46:22 ; 48:16 ; once of time, יָמַי מִדַּת Psa 39:5 ; probably also Job 11:9 (figurative of God's wisdom) where מִדָּהּ = מִדָּתָהּ , compare Sta § 347, approximately 2 ; מִדּוֺת בֵּית = house of size Jer 22:14 ; מִדָּה אִישׁ = man of size, stature , 1Chr 11:23 ; 20:6 ; so also probably || 2Sam 21:20 (for HCT מדין , Qr מָדוֺן , see [ מַד ]), We Dr Kit Bu; plural Num 13:32 ; Isa 45:14 . 3 measured portion, extent , stretch (of wall) Neh 3:11 , 19 , 20 , 21 , 24 , 27 , 30 , compare Ezek 45:3 . 4 garment (plural poetic) Psa 133:2 . II. [ מִדָּה ] noun feminine tribute (loan-word from Assyrian mandattu , id., √ nadânu = נָתַן Dl HWB 451 , compare Schr COT Ezra 4:13 ; also in Biblical Aramaic ךמדֶּה מִנְדָּה, id. ); — הַמֶּלֶךְ מִדַּת Neh 5:4 . מדה (secondary form of מדד ; √ of following)","rootNote":"feminine of 4055 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 11 23","keyReferences":["1Chr 11 23","1Chr 20 6","1Chr 23 29","1Kgs 6 25","1Kgs 7 9","1Kgs 7 11","1Kgs 7 37","2Chr 3 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":55,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 11 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִדָּ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 20 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":20,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִדָּ֗ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 29","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מִדָּֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 6 25","book":"1Kgs","chapter":6,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִדָּ֥ה","source":